  "correction_rules": [
    "Adjust forecasts downward when sentiment is consistently negative or neutral over recent days.",
    "Reduce forecast magnitude after a sharp spike in price; avoid overreacting to recent highs.",
    "Increase forecast bias correction if sentiment shows strong bullish momentum but price has not yet reversed.",
    "Apply mean reversion bias if recent 30-day price movement is trending sharply away from historical mean.",
    "Lower forecast if sentiment is bullish but historical price action shows weak support or declining momentum.",
    "Increase forecast sensitivity to sentiment shifts near the end of the 30-day window, especially if sentiment turns negative."
